    {
      "key": "tc93c567b386cc25d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Yes. Earnings periods can involve larger gaps, faster movement, wider spreads and greater slippage. Smaller positions and defined exposure may reduce risk but cannot remove it.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">はい。収益期間には、より大きなギャップ、より速い動き、より広いスプレッド、より大きなスリッページが含まれる可能性があります。小さなポジションと明確なエクスポージャはリスクを軽減する可能性がありますが、リスクを取り除くことはできません。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6eaa3472f5c0fb66",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Do you need more margin during earnings season?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">決算シーズンにはもっと証拠金が必要ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6c5b0d5ec4b94688",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin depends on the instrument, position size, account and broker rules. Providers may change requirements during unusual volatility, so check the current contract specification.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">証拠金は商品、ポジションサイズ、口座、ブローカーのルールによって異なります。プロバイダーは異常な変動時に要件を変更する可能性があるため、現在の契約仕様を確認してください。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t13a73fdcf916c830",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Eligible UAE traders may access offered instruments subject to platform availability, account terms and jurisdictional requirements. Review the availability note in the introduction before trading.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">適格な UAE トレーダーは、プラットフォームの可用性、口座条件、管轄要件に従って、提供された商品にアクセスできます。取引前に、はじめににある在庫状況に関する注意事項を確認してください。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7898f5f0650de714",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Earnings trading requires more than predicting a beat or miss. Traders must consider guidance, leverage, overnight gaps, spreads and execution.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">決算発表前後の取引では、業績が予想を上回るか下回るかを予測するだけでは不十分です。トレーダーは業績見通し、レバレッジ、翌営業日への価格ギャップ、スプレッド、約定を考慮する必要があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t72aaaf2aafef82ec",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Used together, </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">stop loss and take profit</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> levels help define the planned downside and potential objective before a trade is opened.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">一緒に使用すると、</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">ストップロスとテイクプロフィット</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">のレベルは、取引を開始する前に計画された下値と潜在的な目標を定義するのに役立ちます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6bccc3344e0a5498",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">These orders help traders make exit decisions before entering, but neither guarantees a specific result. During price gaps, fast markets, or low liquidity, a stop-loss may execute beyond the requested level. A take-profit may also remain unfilled if the market does not reach its trigger price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">これらの注文は、トレーダーがエントリー前にエグジットを決定するのに役立ちますが、どちらも特定の結果を保証するものではありません。価格ギャップ、速い市場、または流動性の低下時には、ストップロスが要求されたレベルを超えて実行される場合があります。市場がトリガー価格に達しない場合、テイクプロフィットが満たされないままになることもあります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf52bc68467d0a552",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The simplest </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">stop loss meaning</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> is a planned exit for a trade that moves in the wrong direction. For a long position, the stop-loss is normally placed below the entry price. For a short position, it is normally placed above the entry price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最も単純な</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">ストップロスの意味</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">は、間違った方向に進む取引の計画された終了です。ロングポジションの場合、ストップロスは通常エントリー価格よりも下に設定されます。ショートポジションの場合、通常はエントリー価格よりも高く設定されます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7eeb1df7a1a80edd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Take-Profit Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">利益確定注文とは何ですか?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfb561c618cfd18e9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A take-profit is an instruction to close a position automatically when price reaches a predefined profit-taking level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">利食いとは、価格が事前に定義された利食いレベルに達したときにポジションを自動的に決済する命令です。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc7903fd5eaac26ad",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a long position, the take-profit is normally above the entry price. For a short position, it is normally below the entry price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ロングポジションの場合、テイクプロフィットは通常エントリー価格を上回ります。ショートポジションの場合、通常はエントリー価格を下回ります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td5dba1968dcfa75a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A take-profit helps prevent a trader from repeatedly extending a target because of excitement or greed. It also makes the intended reward measurable before the trade begins.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">テイクプロフィットは、トレーダーが興奮や貪欲さのためにターゲットを繰り返し拡張することを防ぐのに役立ちます。また、取引を開始する前に、意図した報酬を測定できるようになります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t33ae9e315a5cf783",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">If price reaches the take-profit trigger, the platform submits the position for closing. This example explains order mechanics only and is not a recommendation or expected result.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">価格が利食いトリガーに達すると、プラットフォームは決済用のポジションを送信します。この例は順序の仕組みのみを説明するものであり、推奨または期待される結果ではありません。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t910b796c889aa1c0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop-Loss vs. Take-Profit</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">ストップロスとテイクプロフィット</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1abcde0da401837d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Take-Profit</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">テイクプロフィット</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tade222d9f7dfd81d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Limits the planned loss</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
